  "content": "[Intro]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[G]Pennsylvania snow is\npretty thick\nMichigan ain't where I\nget my kicks\n[C]Texas is fine but it\ngets too hot\nAnd\n[G]New York City's not a\nplace to stop\n[D]New Orleans is the\nhome of the blues\nBut\n[G]California's my home with\nMary Hughes\n\n[Solo]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[G]Down in Mississippi I'm\ntold is nice\nAnd\nall the meals there, they\ncome with rice\n[C]Oregon and Iowa are\nnot for me\nThe\n[G]Colorado mountains are\nsomething you must see\nBut\n[D]back in California there's\nnothing to lose\n'Cos\n[G]everything's swinging there with\nMary Hughes\n\n[Outro]\n[G]",
